title Settle - High Level Design v3
direction right

People and tools [icon: users] {
  WebApp [icon: react, label: "Web app on Vercel (Admin, Engineer, Viewer; public status page)"]
  MCPClient [icon: bot, label: "AI assistant (MCP client)"]
}

Signal sources [icon: radar] {
  Probes [icon: radar, label: "Probes in 2-3 regions and heartbeat pings"]
  AlertTools [icon: bell-ring, label: "Grafana alert rules and other tools"]
  CI [icon: github-actions, label: "CI deploy events"]
  DemoShop [icon: store, label: "Demo shop with fault switches"]
}

Backend on Render [icon: server] {
  Monitoring [icon: activity, label: "Monitors and heartbeats (down when 2 regions agree)"]
  Intake [icon: inbox, label: "Alert intake (dedup and grouping)"]
  Incident [icon: siren, label: "Incidents (lifecycle, SLA clocks, roles, timeline)", color: orange]
  Catalog [icon: calendar-clock, label: "Services, on-call, and deploys"]
  Telemetry [icon: line-chart, label: "Logs and metrics queries"]
  Relay [icon: repeat, label: "Outbox relay and escalation worker"]
}

Data [icon: database] {
  Postgres [icon: postgresql, label: "PostgreSQL on Supabase (incidents, timeline, audit, outbox)"]
}

Messaging [icon: rabbitmq] {
  RabbitMQ [icon: rabbitmq, label: "RabbitMQ (with a dead-letter queue)"]
  Workers [icon: cpu, label: "Workers: notifications, live updates, AI jobs"]
}

AI service [icon: python] {
  AIFeatures [icon: sparkles, label: "AI features (suggest only)"]
  MCPServer [icon: plug, label: "MCP server"]
}

Grafana Cloud [icon: grafana] {
  Prometheus [icon: prometheus, label: "Prometheus (metrics)"]
  Loki [icon: file-text, label: "Loki (logs)"]
}

Models [icon: brain] {
  Ollama [icon: brain, label: "Ollama (default)"]
  Hosted [icon: cloud, label: "Hosted LLM (optional)"]
}

WebApp > Backend on Render: /api (JWT)
MCPClient > MCPServer: personal access token
MCPServer > Backend on Render: REST API as the user
Probes > Monitoring: results and pings
AlertTools > Intake: /webhooks/alerts (tool token)
CI > Catalog: /webhooks/deploys
DemoShop > Grafana Cloud: logs and metrics

Monitoring > Intake: raise alert
Intake > Incident: create or link
Incident > Catalog: who is on call
Telemetry > Grafana Cloud: PromQL and LogQL

Backend on Render > Postgres
Relay --> RabbitMQ: publish events
RabbitMQ --> Workers
Workers --> AIFeatures: AI jobs
Incident --> AIFeatures: find similar (optional)

AIFeatures > MCPServer: evidence tools
AIFeatures > Ollama
AIFeatures --> Hosted: optional
